recommend keep-going apprise_the_raiser at fifteen identical bodies over sixteen declarations by fifty lines -- 658 by realized fall, zero widening, the shape the queue now favors with the reader-box family closed: a short ladder carrying a long body. Behind it redress_the_meeting at 645 over sixteen and weigh_the_answer at 624 over fourteen, both zero. Then confirm_pruned 516 over forty-four, seat_note 504 opening three, revoke_one 468 opening forty. The ones that truly cost: choose_pass 630 opening 129, may_pass 574 opening 96, load_one 549 opening 120, read_own_line 492 opening 126. mend_the_plan is spent at 72. Note that apprise_the_raiser's sixteenth declaration holds a different body, so the lap opens by reading which rung differs and why before folding the fifteen.
